WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.535
A potential major development in Ukraine.

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.004
The United Kingdom has confirmed

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:04.938
that it is supplying

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.740
Ukraine with multiple storm

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.808
shadow cruise missiles.

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.043
This equipment

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:11.177
gives Ukrainian

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.346
forces a new, longer range

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.481
strike capability

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:15.015
in advance

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.616
of an expected counteroffensive

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:18.251
against Russian forces.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:19.586
The news comes as Ukraine's

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:20.820
military says that its

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.689
troops have conducted what they call

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.391
effective counterattacks

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:25.558
in the buff moot area.

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:26.926
That city in the east

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:27.660
has seen fierce

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.396
fighting for 11 months now.

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:30.497
According to Kiev, Russian

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:31.464
troops have already been

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:32.132
pushed back

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:34.868
as much as two kilometers in some areas.

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:37.670
CNN's Nick Paton Walsh is in the Zappa

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:38.772
rich region.

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:40.040
Nick, Ukraine

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.441
has been asking

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:42.275
for missiles

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:44.878
with a longer range for some time.

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:46.312
It seems that they are

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.580
finally getting it.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.149
What kind of a difference could this make

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.254
It does appear they already have them.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:55.688
They've been asking the US to supply.

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:58.391
The attack comes with its 185 mile range.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:00.760
But these UK storm shadows

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.762
have 155 mile range,

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:03.963
which essentially brings

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:05.632
much of the Crimean peninsula

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:06.766
occupied by Russia,

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:08.768
possibly even some part of Russia's

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:09.903
border areas,

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.037
although it's clear

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:12.138
as part of this donation

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.073
they will not be striking

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:15.308
inside Russian territory proper

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:17.377
before the 2014 reestablishing of borders

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:18.711
by Russia's occupation.

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:19.712
It does potentially

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.015
allow Ukraine to be more targeting

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:22.649
of key

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:24.150
Russian military infrastructure

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.685
in those occupied areas.

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:26.419
And I wonder

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:27.387
if this announcement

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:28.922
is perhaps coming out to be clear

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.156
that it's a UK donation

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:31.524
allowing them to have this greater

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:32.292
effective range.

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:33.359
So there's no confusion

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:33.660
as to

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.428
whether the US had, for example,

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.697
secretly supplied some extra capability.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.866
It does potentially change the precision

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:40.667
and depth

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.102
that Ukraine can exercise

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.736
into occupied areas,

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:45.271
but also to it's important to point out

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.273
we've seen sabotage, we've seen drones

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.475
attacking some of these areas.

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:50.477
It seems over the past weeks too.

00:01:50.477 --> 00:01:51.411
So a clear

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:51.811
sign,

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.313
I think, of the United Kingdom often

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:55.181
wanting to be the first to supply tanks

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.283
or seem the most pioneering

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:57.817
in terms of what

00:01:57.817 --> 00:01:59.319
it's willing to give Ukraine.

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:00.720
Does that put greater pressure

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.654
on the United States

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:02.822
to add to the inventory?

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:04.157
We'll have to wait and see,

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:04.991
but it again

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:05.992
puts emphasis on

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:07.827
when this counteroffensive may begin

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:08.561
and we may see it

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:09.963
publicly We're hearing

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.264
today, too, from Russia's

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:13.066
mercenary head, Yevgeny Prigozhin,

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:15.301
that his forces are losing ground

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.503
in parts of Bermuda,

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:18.671
having to withdraw into that city center.

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:20.073
He says because of

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:21.441
Ukrainian counter offensive,

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:23.409
he goes on after days, frankly,

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:23.910
of railing

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:25.211
against the mismanagement of war

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.913
by the Kremlin's top brass.

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:27.947
He goes on to warn

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:29.849
this potentially could lead Ukraine

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:30.650
to push all the way

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.019
through and make a decisive strike

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:34.854
inside occupied areas.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:36.689
On top of that to

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:38.258
ahead of this counteroffensive,

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:38.658
President

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:39.159
former President

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:40.560
Donald Trump's comments yesterday

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.395
refusing to say he wants Ukraine to win

00:02:42.395 --> 00:02:42.662
the war.

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:44.430
That's going to focus a lot of minds here

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.532
as to how vital

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:46.699
this summer is

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:47.901
and how Western support

00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:50.370
is a guarantee forever. Back to you.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.871
No question about that, Nick Paton Walsh.

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:53.406
Something is happening in Baku.

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:54.040
We are getting more

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.508
and more reports from that region.

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:56.809
The next few days could be crucial.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:58.278
Thank you so much for your reporting.

00:02:58.278 --> 00:03:01.247
We're getting details of explosive

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:02.415
allegations this hour

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:04.417
from the US ambassador to South Africa

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:06.486
who accuses the government

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:08.555
of supplying arms to Russia.

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:09.889
Ambassador Reuben Brigety

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:11.357
told local news media

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:14.360
that arms and ammunition were loaded onto

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.662
a sanctioned Russian

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:17.597
cargo vessel late last year.

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:18.431
CNN's

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:19.499
David McKenzie joins us

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:21.401
live now from Johannesburg.

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:23.069
So, you know, we've seen South

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:25.772
Africa participating, David, in joint

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:27.440
military exercises with Russia.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:28.208
Obviously,

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.510
they have refused to condemn the war,

00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:32.579
at least against the Russians.

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:33.947
And they've also wavered about

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:36.149
how to potentially handle Putin,

00:03:36.149 --> 00:03:38.251
maybe visiting South Africa

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:40.019
during the BRICS summit later on

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:40.787
this year.

00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:42.155
That has caused the Americans

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:43.990
so much unease,

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:46.159
this idea that South Africa could indeed

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:48.194
be sending ammunition to Russia

00:03:48.194 --> 00:03:50.597
clearly is a huge problem for the West

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:54.100
Well, it's a

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.034
huge problem

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:55.835
for the West,

00:03:55.835 --> 00:03:57.003
but it's also a huge problem

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:58.171
for South Africa, Zain.

00:03:58.171 --> 00:04:00.273
If it turns out to be true,

00:04:00.273 --> 00:04:02.242
this is a sanctioned vessel

00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:03.109
by the US last

00:04:03.109 --> 00:04:06.246
May, as the vessel is a Russian cargo

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:07.614
ship known to be,

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:09.916
according to the US Treasury,

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:12.318
transporting weapons and ammunition

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:13.620
for the Russian Federation

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:14.387
over some time.

00:04:14.387 --> 00:04:16.623
It was sanctioned last year.

00:04:16.889 --> 00:04:17.323
And then you have

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:19.292
this mysterious situation

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:21.494
when the lady are, as it's known,

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:22.262
a doctor

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:25.131
in the main naval port of South Africa

00:04:25.298 --> 00:04:27.767
in a military naval port

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:30.136
near Cape Town for several days.

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:32.405
And there were questions at that time,

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:33.806
what exactly was it doing,

00:04:33.806 --> 00:04:35.541
the allegations from the opposition

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.710
that there were late night

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.146
cargo being taken on and off and all this

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:42.081
very direct statement

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:44.284
from the US ambassador to local media,

00:04:44.884 --> 00:04:48.921
both on camera and in audio, saying that

00:04:49.389 --> 00:04:52.225
they believe that this vessel left

00:04:52.225 --> 00:04:53.559
South African shores

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:56.162
with Russian arms and ammunition.

00:04:56.162 --> 00:04:57.463
When the ambassador was asked

00:04:57.463 --> 00:04:59.132
how confident he is

00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:00.333
on that intelligence,

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:01.067
he said, quote,

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:02.502
We are confident that the weapons

00:05:02.502 --> 00:05:03.703
were loaded onto the vessel

00:05:03.703 --> 00:05:06.139
and I would bet my life on it

00:05:06.506 --> 00:05:07.974
is a very direct comments

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:08.975
from the most senior

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:09.842
diplomats

00:05:09.842 --> 00:05:10.743
of the US here

00:05:10.743 --> 00:05:11.878
in South Africa

00:05:11.878 --> 00:05:13.546
and continues

00:05:13.546 --> 00:05:15.615
these allegations against South Africa

00:05:15.615 --> 00:05:16.983
that is not neutral,

00:05:16.983 --> 00:05:19.619
but rather siding with Russia and

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:22.622
And David, it is very unusual,

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:23.656
as you just touched on there,

00:05:23.656 --> 00:05:24.390
for an ambassador

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:25.725
to make an accusation like it

00:05:25.725 --> 00:05:26.459
like this, isn't it

00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:29.762
Yes, it is.

00:05:29.762 --> 00:05:30.630
And I

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:31.331
think this would be

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:33.266
a very calculated move.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:34.500
It's also

00:05:34.801 --> 00:05:36.903
telling that the international media,

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:38.237
like CNN and others,

00:05:38.237 --> 00:05:40.306
we're not invited to that briefing.

00:05:40.306 --> 00:05:41.207
This is a message

00:05:41.207 --> 00:05:43.209
meant for South Africa,

00:05:43.209 --> 00:05:44.477
for the South African press,

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:45.378
of course,

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:47.113
due to the potential gravity

00:05:47.113 --> 00:05:48.448
of these accusations.

00:05:48.448 --> 00:05:50.416
It would become global news.

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:51.551
But this was a message

00:05:51.551 --> 00:05:53.953
directed at South Africa,

00:05:53.953 --> 00:05:56.189
at the president by the US ambassador.

00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:58.291
You have seen a more assertive line

00:05:58.291 --> 00:06:00.093
coming from US diplomats

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:00.993
about South Africa's

00:06:00.993 --> 00:06:01.794
stance

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:03.563
on the Russian invasion

00:06:03.563 --> 00:06:05.131
of Ukraine in recent months.

00:06:05.131 --> 00:06:06.699
But this is certainly the most

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:09.469
direct accusation in that South Africa

00:06:09.702 --> 00:06:11.971
is potentially arming

00:06:11.971 --> 00:06:14.107
this state that invaded Ukraine.

00:06:14.507 --> 00:06:15.842
We expect a statement

00:06:15.842 --> 00:06:17.977
shortly from the South African presidency

00:06:18.244 --> 00:06:19.212
on this matter.

00:06:19.212 --> 00:06:21.381
I'm sure that will be forceful.

00:06:21.381 --> 00:06:23.116
But they have repeatedly said here

00:06:23.116 --> 00:06:24.016
in the country that they

00:06:24.016 --> 00:06:25.385
are neutral on this issue,

00:06:26.386 --> 00:06:26.853
though they

00:06:26.853 --> 00:06:27.620
did host war

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.889
games with the Chinese

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:31.457
and the Russians earlier

00:06:31.457 --> 00:06:33.659
this year and could be even hosting

00:06:33.659 --> 00:06:35.094
Vladimir Putin later,

00:06:35.094 --> 00:06:37.363
later this year at the BRICS summit.

00:06:37.363 --> 00:06:38.030
So I'm sure they'll

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.732
be significant fallout

00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:40.633
after these comments

00:06:40.633 --> 00:06:42.301
from the US ambassador.

00:06:42.301 --> 00:06:45.004
And if it more evidence does emerge

00:06:45.405 --> 00:06:46.773
that weapons will be sent

00:06:46.773 --> 00:06:47.940
from South Africa,

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:48.608
to Russia,

00:06:48.608 --> 00:06:50.676
then it becomes also an issue

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.012
of sanctions busting.

00:06:53.012 --> 00:06:54.213
Potentially,

00:06:54.213 --> 00:06:55.681
though, South Africa maintains

00:06:55.681 --> 00:06:57.984
it wants to maintain good relations

00:06:58.117 --> 00:07:00.720
with all sides Zain.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:02.121
Yeah, that may be difficult to do.

00:07:02.121 --> 00:07:03.289
David McKenzie live for us there.

00:07:03.289 --> 00:07:04.257
Thank you so much.

